    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91563" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῠρακτ-όω</span></b> ,= foreg. <i><span class="en">
			1
		</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βέλη, ξύλα</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Plu.
			2.624b
		</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
			762b
		</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύλα, τόξα, βέλη
		πεπυρακτωμένα</span>, <i><span class="en">
			D.S.
			3.25
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Str.
			17.2.3
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Scyl.
			112
		</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρακτωθεὶς τὸν μηρόν</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wounded by such a weapon</i>,
			dub.l.in <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tox.</u>
				55
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεπυρακτῶσθαι</span>, opp.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐψύχθαι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				10.164
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				165
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>heat</i> a cautery-iron, in 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Leonid.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				6.44
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.280
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph. in 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be inflamed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζήλῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					2.9
				</span></i>
			.</div>
